# Alert when the server needs a reboot: reboot-required flag, a newer installed kernel than the running one,
# or a pending kernel/microcode update according to needrestart (see /usr/local/sbin/reboot-required-check).
check program reboot-required with path "/usr/local/sbin/reboot-required-check"
    every 30 cycles
    if status != 0 then alert
